  "text": ">\nLocations:\nLavarock Bay\nLavarock Shore\nPrice:\nN/A (Reward from the '\nForging the Burning Sword of Doom\n' quest)\nSellback:\n0 AC\nRarity:\nLegendary Rarity\nBase Damage:\n30-30\nDescription:\nAn infamous blade touched by relentless fire. The blade has become jagged and burns to the touch. If there was a Shadow that hid inside, it has now been irrevocably changed. Such is the nature of molten flame.\nNotes:\nWhen equipped, this item does 51% more damage to\nall monsters\n.\nAlso see\nList of all Necrotic Swords\n.\nThanks to Apus.\nwindow['nitroAds'].createAd('wad-aqwwiki-below-content', {\n  \"refreshTime\": 30,\n  \"renderVisibleOnly\": false,\n  \"refreshVisibleOnly\": true,\n  \"sizes\": [ [ 300, 250 ] ],\n  \"report\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"wording\": \"Report Ad\",\n    \"position\": \"bottom-right\"\n  }\n  });\n0ac\n_b\nac\nanimated\nfixed-dmg\nflaming\nfreeplayer\nhorns\nioda-excl\nlimbs\nnsod\nquestreward\nseasonal\nskeletal\nsummerbreak\nsword\nxdmg2monsters",
